# Origin that serves /api/send-message and /api/sync-mailboxes (the main
# sellamre.com Vercel project, which owns the root-level api/ folder — the
# admin dashboard is typically its own Vercel project with root directory
# "admin", so it can't reach those routes at its own origin). Leave empty to
# call them same-origin (only correct if admin is deployed from the same
# Vercel project/domain as the main site).
